  "body": "## What's Changed\n* chore: archive and finalize WI-768 release closure by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/752\n* docs: reconcile performance Work Item terminal states by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/753\n* docs: recover WI-769 terminal documentation lifecycle by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/754\n* docs: promote WI-770 terminal projections by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/755\n* docs: record declined WI-773 status optimization by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/756\n* docs: recover WI-775 archive evidence by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/759\n* docs: promote closed WI-776 documentation by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/761\n* fix: preserve truthful abandoned finalization state by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/762\n* Improve trust diagnostics and outcome consistency by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/763\n* docs(ai): repair recovered parity registrations by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/766\n* chore(ai): recover WI-786 finalization boundary by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/767\n* docs: recover WI-785 and WI-787 projections (WI-791) by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/769\n* release: v0.2.90 recovery successor by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/771\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/compare/v0.2.89...v0.2.90",
